<title>UK: UK gilt auction -- full results.</title>
<headline>UK gilt auction -- full results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are full results of the</p>
<p>UK gilt auction</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 2.0 bln</p>
<p>COUPON: 8.0 percent</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2021</p>
<p>COVER: 2.32 TIMES</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD:6.86%</p>
<p>LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE:113-06</p>
<p>PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE: 72%</p>
<p>NOTES:The yield tail was one basis point and the price tail 3/32. A total of 4.633 billion pounds in bids was received. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
